# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo and on checkout, so generated artifacts
# (design tokens, etc.) are byte-identical across Windows/macOS/Linux. This keeps the
# CI token drift-check deterministic and avoids CRLF churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
